== evidence: 03-h3-panel-refresh.log — did a finished analysis ever reach the panel? ==
time=2026-11-01T19:12:11+08:00

### BEFORE (git HEAD): DiagnosticsPanel refreshed only in its constructor
$ git show HEAD:src/workspace/diagnostics/diagnostics_panel.cpp | grep -n "refreshFromController|QTimer"
41:    refreshFromController();
72:void DiagnosticsPanel::refreshFromController()
(no QTimer, one refreshFromController() at the end of the constructor)

### BEFORE (git HEAD): nothing polled controller.refresh() after startup
$ git show HEAD:src/workspace/diagnostics/diagnostics_integration.cpp | grep -n "refresh()"
186:        controller->refresh();
(the panel factory calls it once when the dock is created)

### AFTER: the panel owns a 300 ms poll timer (the selftest drives it for real: no manual refresh)
$ grep -n "pollTimer_|void DiagnosticsPanel::poll" src/workspace/diagnostics/diagnostics_panel.cpp
50:    pollTimer_ = new QTimer(this);
51:    pollTimer_->setInterval(300);
